---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Strix Engineering Studio" description="How Strix Engineering Studio handles website preferences, contact enquiries and embedded third-party content." canonical="/privacy/">
<section class="section-space">
  <div class="strix-container-narrow space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-4 border-b border-border pb-8">
      <p class="editorial-meta text-primary">Legal / Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="editorial-serif type-display-lg">Privacy policy.</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: 27 November 2026</p>
      <p class="body-large text-muted-foreground">This page explains the limited information involved when you visit the Strix Engineering Studio website or contact the studio.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="editorial-serif text-2xl">Browser storage</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The website uses browser local storage to remember your light or dark appearance preference and the choice made in the cookie notice. This is not a server-side account and is not used by the site to identify you.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="editorial-serif text-2xl">Analytics and advertising</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The current public website does not enable advertising cookies or analytics trackers. If optional analytics are introduced, this notice and the site's consent controls should be updated before those technologies are activated.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="editorial-serif text-2xl">Contact enquiries</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">When you contact the studio by email or submit an enquiry, the information you choose to provide may be used to understand and respond to your request, discuss project scope and maintain relevant business communication. Do not submit passwords, payment credentials or other sensitive information through a general enquiry.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="editorial-serif text-2xl">Third-party links and embedded previews</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">This website links to external services and may embed previews such as Google Play or a project website. When your browser loads content from another provider, that provider may process connection data under its own privacy policy. You can open the provider directly instead of using an embedded preview.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="editorial-serif text-2xl">Your choices and contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">You can clear this site's local storage through your browser settings to reset saved appearance and cookie preferences. For privacy questions about a website enquiry, contact <a class="underline hover:text-primary" href="mailto:team@strix.website">team@strix.website</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>